 "note": "L, 19 platforms, open, inward, 2v2. A ring road runs round the map; teammates share k. The centre is a rotor hub: its pair of bridges turns from the middle road (m / m') to the axis (t / z), and it has no fixed deck. The bottom diagonal platforms beside it are gates (review 2026-09-29: always some risk near the centre): each draws up its bridge into the hub (a gate on the top diagonals would face the camera, rule G09; they keep no bridge into the hub, which leaves the hub's relay button a free 90-degree slot above it, rule G11). Survivor ring: everything inside the ring road.",
